@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
' Pre-exam readiness check (Module 2):
' ViewModels/DashboardViewModel.InitializeAsync (GET /api/exams/student/current gives the requirements) / RunReadinessAsync /
' RetryReadinessItemAsync / ReportReadinessAsync (status "Could not reach server" when the POST fails), UpdateStartEligibility
' (CanStartExam = CanResumeExam || (gateOpen && AttendanceConfirmed && (!RequireReadiness || ReadinessPassed))),
' Services/Readiness/ReadinessCheckService.RunAsync, Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy (EvaluateNetwork, EvaluateCamera,
' EvaluateSecureMode), Services/ApiClient.SubmitReadinessAsync,
' Controllers/ExamsController.SubmitReadiness (POST /api/exams/{id}/readiness: 404 when not assigned; READINESS_PASSED /
' READINESS_FAILED audit row; SaveChangesAsync seals it via AuditChain; hub "ReadinessUpdated" to group exam:{id}).
' Open arrowhead (->>) = asynchronous message with no reply (SignalR push).
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

actor Student
participant "Dashboard\nViewModel" as VM
participant "ApiClient" as API
participant "Exams\nController" as EC
participant "Monitoring\nHub" as HUB
activate VM
activate API
activate EC
EC ->> HUB : ReadinessUpdated
EC --> API : result; pass\nvalid 30 min
deactivate EC
API --> VM : result
deactivate API
alt all checks passed
  VM --> Student : "All checks passed";\nStart can be enabled
else a check failed
  VM --> Student : failed rows,\neach with Retry
  Student -> VM : Retry
  VM -> VM : re-run the check;\nsubmit again
else request failed
  VM --> Student : "Could not reach\nserver"; Start\nstays disabled
end
deactivate VM
@enduml
